#: ui/config/shortcuts.py:49
msgid ""
"<p>No modifier: what changes no data (playback, the playhead, the "
"library's selection, the editor's pages and lock). Ctrl: edits of the "
"data in memory (kept until saved). Ctrl+Shift: what deletes data. On "
